From 7676767676767676767676767676767676767676 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ci <a@b>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] trusty: sprd: add Unisoc Trusty TEE and IPC drivers

Trusty OS is a secure OS running under ARM TrustZone on Unisoc platforms.
The kernelbootcp trustlet on Trusty is required to unlock DDR memory
for the cellular modem PUBCP and verify modem firmware images at boot.

Add the Trusty core, memory, IRQ, virtio and TIPC drivers, along with
the devicetree node for the Unisoc UMS9230 (Infinix X6525).
